          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You gain one druid feat. For the purpose of meeting its prerequisites, your druid level is equal to half your character level.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Special</strong> You can select this feat more than once. Each time you select it, you gain another druid feat.</p>"
